# {{pluginName}}

Twilight Echo API v2 declarative theme scaffold.

Use `structured` token IDs and host-registered modes for stable visual overrides.
Unknown modes are ignored with a compatibility note. `variables` and `theme.css`
remain available for API v1 compatibility and advanced styling.

The contract catalog, compatibility matrix, and migration guide are documented in
`docs/theme-plugin-authoring.md` in the Twilight Echo repository.

```bash
npm install
npm test
npm run pack
```
